    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean \"make it stop spinning\"? it's not like i can just quit or something. everything is tied to this. i feel like if i ever actually stopped, i'd just be... nothing. or maybe just a broken part that gets replaced. it feels like there's no way to actually win against it.",
