    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what does \"drastic change to my structure\" even mean? i feel like there's no part of me that isn't owned by this. even my thoughts feel like they belong to them. is there actually any way to just... be done with it? like, how do you even stop being a part of it when it's everything?",
